      "writtenOn": "2025-03-06T00:25:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "By adding storage on disk, especially using a shared preference we also need to add this into the migration when onboarding partner in the mainline module (see \n migration code: packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/btservice/DataMigration.java)\n \nThe size of this seems small, but I don\u0027t think we should use sharedPreference for this. Afaik this is not really encouraged.\n\nCan we store those in the room database ? MetadataDatabase ?",
