      "writtenOn": "2025-03-06T19:15:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am having second thought...\n\nBecause:\n1/ what you are storing is not device related, I thought you stored what device was last active, but you are just storing when was the last report of any active device (medical). So there is unlikely to be a nice fit in the database for you.\n2/ We don\u0027t care about this data being preserved between major updates (like switching to mainline, or switching phone). It is safe to trash it\n\nSo maybe a shared preference could work here.\n\nBut please have a read at go/sharedpreferences 😊",
      "parentUuid": "b013ea83_602d89a3",
      "revId": "df9763b1d7a47d112f77619d23221db36dc61461",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "93cb9f6c_899020fc",
